  <sharedRules>
    <rule name="Shield of Faith" id="5251-be94-c535-6673" hidden="false" publicationId="1bb1-1c40-9f73-9fdb">
      <description>The model has a 6+ Invulnerable Save. Models that already have an Invulnerable Save improve it by 1 instead, to a best of 4+.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Order (X)" id="c81d-97d6-8640-e9c3" hidden="false" publicationId="1bb1-1c40-9f73-9fdb">
      <description>When building an army, choose one Order for each detachment. Every unit in that detachment gains Order (X), where X is the chosen Order. Saint Celestine, Morvenn Vahl and the Triumph of Saint Katherine may join any Order. Junith Eruita may only join Our Martyred Lady.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Invulnerable Save (X)" id="3340-8300-cc17-3aa4" hidden="false" publicationId="1bb1-1c40-9f73-9fdb">
      <description>The model has an Invulnerable Save of X, which may be taken against any Wound instead of its armour save.</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
</catalogue>
